    "description": "<p>Create piano-house phrases, basslines and arrangement variations. Explore harmonies and drag MIDI directly into your DAW.<br><br>Chordarium 0.3.2 includes macOS VST3, Audio Unit and standalone formats for Apple Silicon and Intel. MIDI out plays Serum or another receiving instrument. DAW Sync follows your DAW tempo and Play/Stop; switch it off for manual BPM. Export or drag the main phrase and individual cards.<br><br>Your purchase includes a one-year plugin license, the installer and license key. On first launch, paste the key from your order or receipt into Activate Chordarium. This enables all MIDI features without web credits.<br><br>Preview piano uses your system audio output. A receiving instrument creates the DAW audio. Try the free online demo at chordarium.com. Installation and MIDI routing: gettembro.com/chordarium.</p>",
